/T (In Step 2.1, we designed the wireframes for Earthmark based on our Step 1 proposal. We created the five core screens \(Home, Country Selection, Continent Map, Country Details, and My Countries\) together with the dialogs they need, such as validation errors, save and remove confirmations, and the note editor. We also defined the navigation flow between screens, and wrote a short explanation for each one.)
/E (In Step 2.1, we designed the wireframes for Earthmark based on our Step 1 proposal. We created the five core screens \(Home, Country Selection, Continent Map, Country Details, and My Countries\) together with the dialogs they need, such as validation errors, save and remove confirmations, and the note editor. We also defined the navigation flow between screens, and wrote a short explanation for each one.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
